---
import ShadcnUIDark from "@/assets/logos/shadcn-ui_dark.svg"
import ShadcnUI from "@/assets/logos/shadcn-ui_light.svg"
import ShadcnXTitle from "@/components/landing/shadcn-x-title.astro"
---

<section class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 items-center">
  <div class="h-full p-6 xs:p-8 flex flex-col gap-2">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold flex items-center gap-3">
      Inspired by
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1">
        <ShadcnUIDark
          class="hidden dark:block"
          width="20"
          height="20"
          fill="currentColor"
        />
        <ShadcnUI
          class="block dark:hidden"
          width="20"
          height="20"
          fill="currentColor"
        />
        shadcn/ui
      </span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-tight">
      shadcn/ui is a game changer that revolutionized the way to build component
      libraries through Composition, Distribution system, and AI-Ready.
    </p>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-tight">
      shipbase/ui is proudly inspired by and based upon shadcn/ui's
      groundbreaking approach.
    </p>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-tight">
      Every component from shipbase/ui is compatible with shadcn distribution
      system.
    </p>
  </div>

  <a
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    class="h-full p-6 xs:p-8 flex flex-col gap-4 bg-card hover:bg-card/80"
    href="https://x.com/shadcn/status/1909619428146528363"
  >
    <ShadcnXTitle />
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
      <p>
        All this from a flat JSON file. A file that can be shared, extended and
        even generated by LLMs.
      </p>
      <p>
        With all these new registries popping up, building will feel like
        "component shopping".
      </p>
      <p>Pick, Generate, Mix and Build. Code is Yours.</p>
    </div>
  </a>

  <a
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    class="h-full p-6 xs:p-8 flex flex-col gap-4 bg-card hover:bg-card/80"
    href="https://x.com/shadcn/status/1937518165640249617"
  >
    <ShadcnXTitle />
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
      <p>
        Distribution is a multiplier for generated code. The registry is
        infrastructure.
      </p>
    </div>
  </a>

  <a
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    class="h-full p-6 xs:p-8 flex flex-col gap-4 bg-card hover:bg-card/80"
    href="https://x.com/shadcn/status/1912966327448584266"
  >
    <ShadcnXTitle />
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
      <p>
        "If you start a React project without shadcn/ui today, you will end up
        with shadcn/ui or something that looks like shadcn/ui"
      </p>
    </div>
  </a>
</section>
